Most often, if your god is pleased when you offer to him/her, the altar
will be converted. Another way is by offering up a unicorn on it;
offering a unicorn corpse that is neither of your alignment nor the
altar's alignment will automatically convert the altar. One big
problem, though, is that altars are rarely generated without a priest
(?), and a priest, cross-aligned or otherwise, is a useful thing to
have.



